WEBVTT

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:26.630
Match set!

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:27.670
That's enough!

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:34.220
Is there another warrior that wants to challenge her?

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:36.220
One piece of gold gets you in.

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:38.050
Twenty pieces if you win.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:39.760
Come on! Someone take her!

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:40.930
I paid to see a fight!

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:43.140
I'll do it.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:47.610
Thanks.

00:00:54.530 --> 00:01:00.030
In a horizon of light and darkness.

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:05.370
Why not obtain these bonds.

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:13.720
They were shining in my hands just now.

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:26.600
The melancholy of one in sever billion.

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:31.940
Someday the end of the world will come.

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:37.320
So what? I'll have no regret.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:45.750
Say, yeah!! Stop running straight after that falling star.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:50.540
Let your worries fade away!!

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:55.840
This blue Earth is nestled in the sky.

00:01:55.840 --> 00:02:01.180
Like I always envisioned Elysium.

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:06.520
I will shape my own past and future.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:11.900
I will look up to the eternal Stellar.

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:17.320
I can hear the song of life.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.960
This is great. I love seeing warriors go at it.

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:37.590
Yeah, the Queen did get rid of the Queen's Blade.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.930
We're lucky we can even see a fight out here like this.

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:43.810
It's sure tough being a warrior.

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:44.890
If they want to earn a meal,

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:45.970
they're forced to join the army...

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:47.310
Or if they don't want to do that,

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.480
fight in unauthorized fights like this one.

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:52.480
Oh yeah, have you heard about

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:54.480
the Ragged Warrior going from town to town

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:55.480
making a mess of things?

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:57.940
Hm? Oh yeah, I've heard of her.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:07.080
Supposedly, she's the successor of one of the noble factions.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:19.050
I wonder what I should do now...

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.800
It was my plan to go out and meet anything I came across,

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:24.550
and not run away from it, but...

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:41.700
Got you!

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.640
So who's the next brave warrior to step up to the plate?

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.220
Come on!

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.680
Give me back my money if they're not going to fight!

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:08.510
Crap.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:31.620
Looks like we've got ourselves a new challenger!

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:33.120
Let's start the fight!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:35.040
I'm not going easy on ya, stranger.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:37.500
Yeah! This is great! Do it!

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.550
This girl...

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:47.720
Stop it! What are you trying to do?!

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:03.570
Yeah!

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:04.320
That was awesome!

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.660
That was quite the spectacle.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.740
You're pretty strong, and cute to boot.

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:11.160
What do you say we team up and make some quick cash?

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:11.870
Huh?

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:13.250
This is bad!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:15.540
The Inquisitor is here!

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.630
W-What? This isn't good.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.420
You'll be burned at the stake if she finds you!

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:20.420
Run!

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:24.590
The Inquisitor...

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:40.860
Why do I have to come here with you?

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:44.900
I'm just here on my standard Inquisition circuit.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.950
You are the one who decided to follow me.

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:49.120
God damn it.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.620
If Ymir never mentioned to me that

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:54.580
surviving Kreutz might be in the area,

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.870
I never would have come to this ass backwards town.

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:59.710
Welcome, Inquisitor!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.710
Thank you very much.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:04.460
H-Here.

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:08.720
I hate these flowers.

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:09.930
Elina-san!

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:15.350
You go be Inquisitor all on your own, or whatever.

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:17.230
I'm going to make my way back home when I feel like it.

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:21.190
Don't cry.

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:25.650
God sees your good deeds.

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:28.570
So Elina's here?

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:30.950
Yeah! Let's go play over here!

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:32.450
There's children out, too.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.620
I have to avoid a fight from breaking out here.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.750
Man, I'm so stupid.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.710
I shouldn't have listened to to Ymir.

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:44.590
Phew, I'm beat.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:47.300
The water's cold!

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.340
There's something under that rock!

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:55.430
Claudette-oneesama trusts Ymir a lot.

00:06:55.970 --> 00:07:00.270
I hate to admit it, but her plans usually work out.

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:03.400
I thought she was just some stupid dwarf,

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:04.690
but she's actually pretty level-headed.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:07.860
There aren't any other windows or exits.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:09.570
This isn't good.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.490
I thought I heard a voice...

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:18.330
I guess it was just my imagination.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.370
The octopus from before...

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:24.130
Why are you here?!

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:28.710
I don't know why,

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:33.220
but Claudette-oneesama has been so wonderful lately...

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:37.140
Leina-oneechan was supposed to be the only one for me...

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:40.180
I want to see Leina-oneechan again.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:42.980
When Onee-chan comes back,

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:44.900
I want Claudette-oneesama and the two

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.480
of us to all play together.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:48.820
Onee-chan...

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.950
Onee-sama...

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:04.460
At this rate, we should reach Gainos in about ten days.

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.800
We're going to get Mirim back,

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:11.800
retrieve the wizard stone, and find Onii-chan.

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:16.260
Anyway, how about we get going, Vante?

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:19.600
Let's go home!

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.930
I wonder what we're having for dinner today?

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:26.480
I miss Onee-sama now.

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:28.320
I guess I'll head back to Gainos.

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:44.580
Well done.

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:46.330
I was unable to find even a

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.090
minor developing case of heresy in this village.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:50.880
Thank you very much, Inquisitor.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:54.470
In that case, we would like to ask something of you.

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:56.300
If it's something within my control...

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:58.010
Then, please.

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:07.730
Now, sit up straight and open your legs wider.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:11.110
This will demonstrate your allegiance to God.

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:14.450
I-Inquisitor... I don't think I can go on...

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.950
Keep trying. You can spread your legs further.

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:20.490
I-I'm honoured, Sigui-sama.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:24.290
Don't call for me. Call for God.

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:26.750
Also, you're bearing your chest in the wrong direction.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:31.840
God lives throughout your entire body.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.090
He lives here.

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:34.510
And here.

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:36.180
And here!

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:38.840
Inquisitor, please instruct me, as well!

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:40.640
Please, me, as well!

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:43.850
My children have been fortunate.

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:46.940
I never would have thought they would have a chance

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.150
to be instructed by Sigui-sama,

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:50.020
one of the most revered members of the Head Ministry.

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:55.190
Inquisitor, you truly are amazing.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:57.110
How did you become so knowledgeable?

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:00.700
Serving God is a never-ending journey.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:03.200
I still have a long way to go.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:08.250
There is one holy pose that I have still yet to master.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.540
Th-There's one even you can't master, Inquisitor?

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:12.290
What type of pose is it?

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.800
It goes by the name "Holy Pose: Fate."

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:22.850
It's the ultimate pose that only those truly

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:25.060
acknowledged are said to be able to complete.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:28.560
I'm no different than any of you when it comes

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.770
to believing in God and continuing on my journey.

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.150
Let's all do our best.

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:34.940
Yes, Inquisitor.

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:38.780
Inquisitor, the people of the town

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:42.030
would love it if you would listen to their problems.

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:43.160
I see.

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:44.910
I'll give them audience.

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:48.000
That inquisitor was pretty amazing.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.460
Here you go!

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:51.170
I went to discuss the problem I've been having at work,

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:54.000
but she told me a wonderful story about God.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:56.460
I feel a lot better now.

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:59.340
She's pretty young, but she's done a lot.

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:01.470
She said there's been so many people coming to see her,

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.890
she moved her departure for the capital to Monday.

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:06.850
Really? Maybe I'll go see her, too.

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:09.560
The Inquisitors...

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:12.860
I've heard good things about them at 
some of the villages I've been to.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:16.480
It seems the Queen allows them to operate,

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:19.450
but I wonder what the Inquisitors think

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:21.160
about how things have turned out.

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:24.530
Oh yeah, I heard that in the South

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:26.580
there was an outbreak and children are dropping like flies.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:29.370
Yeah, it's one of those diseases that wouldn't really be a problem

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:31.790
if there were enough medicine to go around.

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.790
However, because of the fog in the 
Calibara Forest, it seems that

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.880
they're having trouble transporting medicine to the region.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:38.090
The Calibara Forest, huh?

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:41.510
I heard there wasn't any fog in that area in the past.

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:43.800
If they could just get through there without a problem,

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:46.470
they wouldn't have any trouble getting 
the medicine where it needs to go.

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:49.890
I hear that monsters have come to live in the forest.

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:51.640
Really? That's pretty scary.

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:53.060
Monsters?

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.980
The Calibara Forest...

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:00.150
Could the next person please come in.

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.790
What is the matter?

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:16.170
I'm not sure what I should do in life.

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.590
Could you tell me the details?

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:39.980
I see. Just as I thought.

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:43.570
Looks like your invention is coming along well, Ymir-nee.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:46.950
But we're not at the stage where we can sell it, yet.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.990
Looks like we'll be putting this on hold for a while.

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:53.250
I see. Kind of feels like a waste.

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:57.130
I have tons of other inventions I'm working on.

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.960
Eventually all of the weapons used in the Queen's army

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:01.840
will be handled by my Steel Mountain!

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:06.390
I see.

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:09.970
You wanted to get revenge against someone,

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:11.970
but now that you've travelled around the world,

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:14.180
your thinking has changed.

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:15.140
That's right.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:18.940
There are many people on this 
continent that are suffering.

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:23.070
I wonder what I should do in order to save everyone,

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:25.150
and truly make this world a better place.

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:27.200
You have your answer.

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:29.370
You should pray.

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:30.620
Pray?

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:34.870
That's correct. Praying is the 
way to salvation for everyone.

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.620
If everyone offered

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:39.130
prayers to the Lord from the bottom of their hearts,

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:41.500
everyone would have happiness come to them.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:53.600
What are you doing?

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:56.480
It's the holy pose, Worship.

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:59.100
Give everything to the Lord.

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:03.070
The Lord is everything. The Lord is absolute.

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:07.450
So you're saying I should stop thinking?

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:11.030
I believe prayer is necessary.

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:15.040
But I can't leave everything up to God!

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:17.870
I believe that there are things that only humans can accomplish.

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:20.130
That's nothing more than pure arrogance.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:24.250
There is a limit to what a mere human can accomplish.

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:26.550
And that is why I worry!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:30.720
What are you trying to do here?

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:31.720
Huh?

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:33.100
How despicable!

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:36.560
While were talking you had...

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:42.980
P-Please wait!

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:44.230
What are you talking about?

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:46.320
I understand now.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:49.820
It seems you are in need of an Inquisition.

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:51.990
Fight me.

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:55.160
Big news! Big news!

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:58.330
The Inquisitor and a purple-haired beauty of a warrior

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.330
will be fighting behind the church!

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:02.880
This is big news!

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:05.920
This is great.

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:08.090
We get to see this fight up close.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:11.890
The famed Inquisitor against the 
beautiful warrior from yesterday.

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:14.810
You couldn't have picked two better fighters.

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:17.980
I have no reason to fight you.

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:20.350
I will determine whether or not

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:22.270
you are a heretic through this fight.

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:23.940
En garde.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.040
She's strong.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:41.210
This is it.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:43.670
Place your bets.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.420
Come on! Win for me!

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:46.550
Make me some cash!

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:48.840
And thank you.

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:03.560
She's showing no hesitation in this battle.

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:10.070
I-Is this...

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:13.070
Is this what it means to believe in God?

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.920
The Inquisitor's strong...

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:32.340
She took out that warrior?

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:42.430
You still have time.

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:45.270
Swear that God is absolute.

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:49.110
If you do so, I shall forgive you in His name.

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:53.780
Now, let's walk the path that 
God has given us together.

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:02.370
God may be absolute, however...

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:05.040
it's not like me to depend on someone else

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:09.750
before I can walk on my own two feet.

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:13.340
Even if I cannot see the path before me,

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:16.090
I will make the step forward by my own will.

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:20.260
In that case... I shall pass my judgement.

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:23.930
I pronounce you guilty.

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:26.310
I sentence you to being burned alive.

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:41.080
Prepare yourself!

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:44.330
Now!

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:48.540
How dare you?!

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:01.680
Impossible. She cut the Holy Flame with her blade?

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:05.980
I can only perform to my utmost!

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:12.770
She's even stronger than before.

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.650
She's driving back the Inquisitor.

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:16.650
Sh-She's strong!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:18.910
She's like a completely different person now.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:23.200
Has God granted power to her for some reason?

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:38.090
N-No, wait!

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:39.050
Stop!

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:39.890
Not right now!

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:43.430
No! No!

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:48.310
No!

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:51.270
Lord, I thank you for your protection.

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.360
I offer a prayer to you.

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:01.530
I hereby punish the heretic!

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.040
That's...

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:16.130
"Holy Pose: Fate..."

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:47.290
I shall ask your name.

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:50.210
Annelotte Kreutz.

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:00.970
W-Wait...

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:02.340
What's going on?

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:06.850
You find him?

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:08.600
No, he's not here!

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:11.270
Where did that bastard run off to?!

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:14.940
No one won, and then he ran off with our bets!

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:17.360
I've got something special for him once we find him!

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.690
You've gotta be kidding.

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:24.240
I'm not giving back any money I've earned.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:32.160
For you to take bets on the outcome 
of a holy trial is unfathomable.

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:33.960
You are blaspheming God!

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:36.420
N-No... I...

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:38.590
I pronounce you guilty.

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:50.270
There we go...

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:52.850
Hey, Ymir-nee!

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:56.020
I brought the armour, sword, and shield

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:58.190
you asked for from the lab!

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:00.360
Good work.

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:04.910
You're such a slave driver.

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:06.700
You could have brought it up here yourself,

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:08.280
but you made me do it.

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:11.080
I thought you said this afternoon

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:13.830
you'd work on that piece of equipment later.

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:15.710
I changed my mind.

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.380
This is going to be interesting.

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:29.390
The monsters in the Calibara Forest...

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:34.680
I can only perform to my utmost!

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:38.860
I shall go to purify the Calibara Forest!

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:58.250
The light sabre broke, caught up in an inhuman like situation

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:03.550
Things like the reasons that have supported you, have you forgotten them?

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:08.720
Even if you grab it with your left hand, it spills out of your right hand

00:22:08.720 --> 00:22:13.600
It is not like you are even crying, but your sight still gets blurry

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:18.940
The perplexed world that sways and shakes, surely

00:22:18.940 --> 00:22:23.610
Searches for the ticket of the future

00:22:24.150 --> 00:22:29.450
Like getting irritated by a thick sound

00:22:29.450 --> 00:22:33.620
If you do not run forward, there is no goal

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:45.300
Why, oh why is it that my heart hinders me?

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:56.810
No matter how many dozens of times you repeat it, shake off the confusion

00:22:57.180 --> 00:23:07.190
Get up, as you are still dreaming

00:23:10.820 --> 00:23:16.330
Lord, please forgive me for being unable to punish the heretic.

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:18.290
But this is the last time that happens!

00:23:18.290 --> 00:23:20.670
Inquisitor Sigui will exterminate every

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:23.790
non-believer and heretic from this continent.

00:23:23.790 --> 00:23:26.800
Next time: "The Moonlight from the Jungle and the Sun."

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:28.970
How can you wear something so shameless?

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:30.720
Moonlight Dancer?

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:33.470
A non-believer that leads the population astray with her obscene dancing!

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:34.260
She's blaspheming God!

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:35.970
I sentence you to being burned alive!

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:36.970
Burned alive! Burned alive!

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:39.980
You are totally getting burned alive!
